renethack: an upstream backport, dropped when engine/upstream moves to
NetHack 5.0.1.

NetHack 5.0.0 calls impossible() ("newsym: attempting screen update for
<0,0>", then "Program in disorder!") for a vault guard parked off the map
at <0,0>: postmov() redraws the guard's cell at the end of the move in
which it disappears, and see_monsters() does the same while it is parked
(on a redraw or a restore). Upstream fixed both after the release, on
branch NetHack-5.0, and doc/fixes5-0-1.txt lists the fix ("when a vault
guard was moved off the map, an impossible about trying to update map
location <0,0> was issued"):

  c42d35eac0 avoid newsym(0,0) for vault guard
      the postmov() hunk, as it is upstream;
  d13eceb28b eliminate one more source of vault guard newsym msgs
      the see_monsters() hunk: its PARKEDMONSTER() test inlined, without
      its MON_PARKED bit, its macro and its restore fixup.

No play changes: newsym(0,0) did nothing but call impossible(), which
uses no RNG and changes no game state.

--- a/src/display.c
+++ b/src/display.c
@@ -2,6 +2,9 @@
 /* Copyright (c) Dean Luick, with acknowledgements to Kevin Darcy */
 /* and Dave Cohrs, 1990.                                          */
 /* NetHack may be freely redistributed.  See license for details. */
+/* renethack: changed on 2026-10-10 by renethack's patch
+ * 0004-vault-guard-off-map-no-newsym.patch: upstream's fix for a vault guard
+ * parked off the map, backported from NetHack 5.0.1. */
 
 /*
  *                      THE NEW DISPLAY CODE
@@ -1503,7 +1506,8 @@
 
     /* loop through level.monsters (aka fmon) */
     for (mon = fmon; mon; mon = mon->nmon) {
-        if (DEADMONSTER(mon))
+        /* a vault guard parked at <0,0> is not on the map */
+        if (DEADMONSTER(mon) || (mon->isgd && mon->mx == 0))
             continue;
         if ((mon->mstate & MON_STILL_ARRIVING) != 0)
             continue;
--- a/src/monmove.c
+++ b/src/monmove.c
@@ -2,6 +2,9 @@
 /* Copyright (c) Stichting Mathematisch Centrum, Amsterdam, 1985. */
 /*-Copyright (c) Michael Allison, 2006. */
 /* NetHack may be freely redistributed.  See license for details. */
+/* renethack: changed on 2026-10-10 by renethack's patch
+ * 0004-vault-guard-off-map-no-newsym.patch: upstream's fix for a vault guard
+ * parked off the map, backported from NetHack 5.0.1. */
 
 #include "hack.h"
 #include "mfndpos.h"
@@ -1653,7 +1656,9 @@
             u_on_newpos(mtmp->mx, mtmp->my);
             swallowed(0);
         } else {
-            newsym(mtmp->mx, mtmp->my);
+            /* only call newsym() when not a vault guard moving to <0,0> */
+            if (mtmp->mx)
+                newsym(mtmp->mx, mtmp->my);
         }
     } /* mmoved==MMOVE_MOVED */
 
